Description:It is the opponent's turn. You are at 10 life and control Scrounger of Souls (3/4 lifelink). The opponent's Minotaur Warrior (2/3) and Dromoka Warrior (3/1) are attacking you. End the turn at 11 life.
Rule:rulesguru-031fece7640a3d44 | A creature deals combat damage equal to its power whatever the blocked creature's toughness (CR 510.1a), and lifelink gains that much (CR 702.15b): blocking the 3/1 gains 3, not 1
